# Orion Data — local tooling artefacts.
# Nothing here is a source of truth. Everything is regenerated from apps.json
# and the upstream APIs. See docs/SCALING.md for why derived data must never be
# committed to a source branch.

# git checkout of the previous data plane, used to reuse unchanged releases
.prev/

# scripts/build_data.py output
dist/

# scripts/mirror_audit.py fetch cache (holds a full copy of mirror.json)
.cache/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# OS
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Binaries belong in GitHub Releases, never in git history.
*.apk
*.aab
*.apks
*.xapk
*.dex
